ytes, native_policy 3, launch_guard_version 1, file_count 16, labeled as build stdout\",\n    \"build_release.py still requires policy_version 3 and launch_guard_version 1 and sets file_count to len(files_sha256)+1, omitting manifest.json from the map\",\n    \"Operator guide matches the RUNNING.txt text embedded in build_release.py and the corresponding gates in guardian.py, guarded_agent.py, guarded_session.py, release_broker.py, monitor.py, run"...], 0x5f15ed801f20 /* 4 vars */) = 0
